{"text": "Bill begged me with tears in his eyes to ask for fifteen hundred dollars instead of two thousand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody would give up two thousand dollars for that forty pound wildcat, he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The letter, signed Two Desperate Men, said that the boy was hidden in a place far from Summit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It told Dorset to leave the money in a small box at midnight, beside a fence post under a tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he refused, the letter warned, he would never see his boy again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just as I was leaving, the boy made Bill his horse for a ninety mile ride in his Black Scout game. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I walked to the village of Poplar Cove and mailed the letter at the post office. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> An old man there said that the whole town of Summit was worried about old Dorsets missing boy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When I got back to the cave, Bill came out alone, looking calm and strangely happy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sam, I have sent the boy home, he said, The game is over at last. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am sorry, Bill, I said, but turn around and look behind you, There stood the boy.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "i", "l", "l", " ", "b", "e", "g", "g", "e", "d", " ", "m", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "e", "a", "r", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "s", "k", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "f", "i", "f", "t", "e", "e", "n", " ", "h", "u", "n", "d", "r", "e", "d", " ", "d", "o", "l", "l", "a", "r", "s", " ", "i", "n", "s", "t", "e", "a", "d", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "o", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "g", "i", "v", "e", " ", "u", "p", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", " ", 